+  'elig.pmdaksh.group': 'You must belong to a Scheduled Caste, Backward Class, Economically Weaker Section, or a Denotified or Nomadic Tribe, or work as a Safai Mitra (sanitation worker). For Backward Class and Economically Weaker Section, family income must be below Rs.3 lakh a year.',
