+  // --- added 31 Oct 2026, central pension and insurance schemes ---
+  'sdata.apy.description': 'A pension for people in informal work. If you are 18 to 40 years old and do not pay income tax, you can join with a savings account. You pay a fixed amount each month, quarter or half-year, and from the age of 60 you get a monthly pension of Rs.1,000, Rs.2,000, Rs.3,000, Rs.4,000 or Rs.5,000, as chosen when joining. Your spouse then gets the same pension.',
