+  'sdata.pmsby.description': 'Accident insurance for Rs.20 a year, taken from your bank account. If you are 18 to 70 years old and have a bank account, you can join. If you die in an accident, your nominee gets Rs.2 lakh. If you lose both eyes, both hands or both feet, you get Rs.2 lakh. If you lose one eye, or the use of one hand or one foot, you get Rs.1 lakh.',
