+  'elig.npstsep.turnover': 'You must be between 18 and 40 years old, and your yearly turnover must not be above Rs.1.5 crore.',
+  'elig.npstsep.excluded': 'You cannot join if you are a member of EPFO, ESIC, the government-funded NPS or PM-SYM, or if you pay income tax.',
