+  // --- added 31 Oct 2026, central subsidy, training and equipment schemes ---
+  'sdata.cuy.description': 'Money to start a coir unit that makes coir fibre, yarn or coir products. The project can cost up to Rs.10 lakh, plus running money of up to 25% of that cost. You put in 5%, a bank loan gives 55%, and government money gives 40% of the project cost. No government money is given on the running money.',
