+  // --- added 31 Oct 2026, Rajasthan state schemes ---
+  'sdata.rj_digital.description': 'Under its MSME Policy 2024, Rajasthan pays back 75% of what a small business spends on software or equipment to go digital, such as billing machines or stock software. This can be claimed one time, up to Rs.50,000. It also pays back 75% of the fee of one online selling platform, up to Rs.50,000, not counting delivery charges.',
