+  'elig.hrsc.permanent': 'You must be a permanent resident of Haryana.',
+  'elig.hrsc.age': 'You must be between 18 and 45 years old.',
+  'elig.hrsc.sc': 'You must belong to a Scheduled Caste.',
+  'elig.hrsc.income': 'Your family\'s yearly income must be within the scheme\'s limit: at least half of the people helped must have a family income of up to Rs.1,50,000, and the rest up to Rs.3,00,000.',
+  'elig.hrgreen.activities': 'The work must help reduce the greenhouse effect, such as an e-rickshaw, a compressed air vehicle, solar energy gadgets or a polyhouse.',
