+
+  'sdata.hr_laghu.description': 'For Scheduled Caste people in Haryana, aged 18 to 45, who want to start their own work to earn a living. You get a loan for a project of up to Rs.2 lakh. The state\'s Scheduled Castes corporation pays 50% of the cost, up to Rs.10,000, and gives 10% as margin money.',
+  'sdata.hr_laghu.support': 'Loan up to Rs.2 lakh; government pays 50% of cost, up to Rs.10,000',
+
+  'sdata.hr_mahila_kisan.description': 'For Scheduled Caste women in Haryana from families below the poverty line who want to earn from farming and related work. You get a loan for a project of up to Rs.50,000. The state\'s Scheduled Castes corporation pays 50% of the cost, up to Rs.10,000, and gives 10% as margin money.',
+  'sdata.hr_mahila_kisan.support': 'Loan up to Rs.50,000; government pays 50% of cost, up to Rs.10,000',
+  'elig.hrsc.bpl': 'Your family must be below the poverty line, with a yearly family income not above the poverty-line limit.',
